WEBVTT

00:00:05.468 --> 00:00:08.773
Managers claim that inclusive
practices are already showing

00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:11.890
benefits in ways far beyond
reputational enhancement.

00:00:13.089 --> 00:00:16.990
These include productivity gains,
quality improvement, boost in innovative

00:00:16.991 --> 00:00:19.310
capabilities, and growth
in employee engagement.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.710
They've begun thinking more deeply about
leveraging the talents of all employees

00:00:25.021 --> 00:00:27.670
through greater sensitivity
to individual needs.

00:00:28.882 --> 00:00:30.520
Better pattern recognition

00:00:32.356 --> 00:00:34.944
Large companies,
particularly tech companies,

00:00:35.124 --> 00:00:38.670
have realized that they already had
neurodiverse talent on their staff.

00:00:40.015 --> 00:00:43.633
Many of these employees contribute their
special skills in pattern recognition,

00:00:44.623 --> 00:00:45.643
memory,

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.730
or mathematics on teams working
to solve highly complex problems.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:58.238
In the fields of machine learning,
artificial intelligence, and data science,

00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:03.491
neurodiverse employees have proven to
outperform their neurotypical counterparts.

00:01:04.686 --> 00:01:05.760
Creative thinking

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:09.350
Variations in their neurological
constitution allows

00:01:09.351 --> 00:01:13.777
neurodivergent employees to think
differently or out of the box.

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:18.062
They're able to see past the
conventional frameworks which

00:01:18.063 --> 00:01:21.110
could limit the creativity
of neurotypical individuals.

00:01:22.712 --> 00:01:25.837
Positive work environment or
an organization's reputation

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.490
According to the
training industry,

00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:31.530
employers who have opened
their doors to a neurodiverse

00:01:31.531 --> 00:01:34.692
workforce have found that
neurodiverse and autistic

00:01:34.717 --> 00:01:38.531
employees have a retention
rate upwards of 90%.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.214
Moreover, having neurodiverse
talent in your workforce

00:01:43.448 --> 00:01:47.270
improves a company's external
as well as internal image.

00:01:49.022 --> 00:01:53.010
When a brand has a strong purpose,
consumers are four times more likely to

00:01:53.011 --> 00:01:55.777
trust the company and
six times more likely

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.820
to defend the
company from criticism.